#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.7"
msgstr "v3.6.7"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.7 is a small framebuffer-correctness release: the frame buffer now "
"respects the ``fb_alloc`` allocator, the frame-size check when copying "
"images to the framebuffer was fixed, and an internal frame-buffer-size "
"helper was added. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v3.6.6 scripts"
" run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.7 adalah rilis kecil untuk perbaikan kebenaran framebuffer: buffer "
"bingkai kini menghormati alokator ``fb_alloc``\\ , pemeriksaan ukuran "
"bingkai saat menyalin citra ke framebuffer diperbaiki, dan helper ukuran "
"buffer bingkai internal ditambahkan. Rilis ini **tidak mengubah API** — "
"skrip v3.6.6 berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Pada halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Framebuffer correctness** — the frame buffer now respects the ``fb_alloc``"
" allocator."
msgstr ""
"**Kebenaran framebuffer** — buffer bingkai kini menghormati alokator "
"``fb_alloc``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:22
msgid "**Fix** — the frame-size check when copying images to the framebuffer."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan** — pemeriksaan ukuran bingkai saat menyalin citra ke "
"framebuffer."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:23
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.6.6 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API yang merusak** — reflash dan skrip v3.6.6 Anda "
"berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:27
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:29
msgid "Framebuffer:"
msgstr "Framebuffer:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:31
msgid ""
"The frame buffer now respects the ``fb_alloc`` allocator, the frame-size "
"check when copying images to the framebuffer (``copy_to_fb``) was fixed, and"
" an internal frame-buffer-size helper (excluding the header size) was added "
"and corrected."
msgstr ""
"Buffer bingkai kini menghormati alokator ``fb_alloc``\\ , pemeriksaan ukuran"
" bingkai saat menyalin citra ke framebuffer (\\ ``copy_to_fb``\\ ) "
"diperbaiki, dan helper ukuran buffer bingkai internal (tidak termasuk ukuran"
" header) ditambahkan dan dikoreksi."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:37
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.7.rst:39
msgid ""
"v3.6.7 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.6.6 run unchanged on v3.6.7 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.7 **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan Python API yang merusak**\\ . Skrip "
"yang berjalan pada v3.6.6 berjalan tanpa perubahan pada v3.6.7 — cukup "
"reflash firmware."
